{"id":"wb-8-231","name":"普救寺塔","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"普救寺塔","text":"普救寺塔，位于山西省运城市永济市市区西北12公里的蒲州镇西厢村北隅，是中华人民共和国山西省文物保护单位之一。\n1965年5月24日，授予山西省文物保护单位，编号1-111，是一座古建筑及历史纪念建筑物。2019年10月7日升格为全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%99%AE%E6%95%91%E5%AF%BA%E5%A1%94","revisionId":90843890,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=90843890","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/025cd32d2eae2de3137160e7.jpg","title":"Pujiu_Temple,_6_October_2017.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Pujiu_Temple,_6_October_2017.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/8c/Pujiu_Temple%2C_6_October_2017.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"hwcmsb@126","license":"CC BY 2.5","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/2.5","caption":"​山西省永济市普救寺。","width":320,"height":240}}